{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an exhilarating journey to ascend to the peak of an ever-changing world in &quot;Dash or Die.&quot; Armed with unique abilities like double jump and dash, your quest is anything but ordinary. Navigate through an array of richly detailed environments, each offering distinct challenges and gameplay mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Double Jump &amp; Dash: Master the art of movement with your special double-jump and dash abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glide: Fly you way down to the nearest platform if you fall ! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Environments: Traverse through rich verious environements changin through your ascend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-Stakes Gameplay: The higher you climb, the harder the fall. One misstep could send you tumbling down, forcing you to start your ascent all over again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What to Expect:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An adrenaline-fueled adventure that will challenge both your reflexes and wits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A game world that is as beautiful as it is treacherous, filled with hidden secrets and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A risk-and-reward system that will keep you at the edge of your seat, compelling you to reach new heights or face the consequences.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2532910?t=1761141931","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2532910?t=1761141931","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532910/1ce13824aa6f9e491271c5b305edbbb0b28e0053/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761141931","capsule